---
layout: base.njk
title: About Us
description: "Learn about Annada Qur'an & Science Academy's history, mission, vision, and educational philosophy."
permalink: /about/
---

<section class="hero" style="padding: var(--space-xl) 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About {{ site.shortName }}</h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">Our story, our mission, and what we stand for.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Our History</h2>
      <p>{{ site.orgName }} was established in {{ site.established }} in {{ site.address.line1 }}, {{ site.address.line2 }}, with a clear purpose: to raise a generation grounded in Qur'anic knowledge and equipped with strong scientific understanding.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>{{ site.mission }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>{{ site.vision }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for value in site.values %}
      <div class="card">
        <h3>{{ value.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ value.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Our Educational Philosophy</h2>
      <p>We believe Qur'anic education and scientific learning are not in tension — they strengthen one another. Our students are taught to approach both their faith and their studies with seriousness, curiosity, and discipline.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
